{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN THE EARLY MORNING HOURS OF JUNE 6, 1944,</strong> the soldiers of the 101st Airborne were handed one of the toughest assignments of WWII - a night drop behind enemy lines to secure territory before D-Day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back in time to that fateful night to lead a &quot;stick&quot; of 18 paratroopers through multiple campaigns and combat engagements in this realistic initiative-based strategy simulation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initiative-based gameplay with nine challenging campaigns, each with 28 individual combat engagements and 42 highly detailed maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate weaponry, damage modelling and detailed topography.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute infantry-style tactics to complete your mission while fighting through surprise enemy attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form unique squads from a selection of 48 troops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique soldier animations and 3D-animated cut scenes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863630?t=1756853432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863630?t=1756853432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863630/114302eaa218a089c50765d2cc2cc4659994f463/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756853432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863630/114302eaa218a089c50765d2cc2cc4659994f463/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756853432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN THE EARLY MORNING HOURS OF JUNE 6, 1944,</strong> the so